    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-11T15:55:59+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-11T15:55:59+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-11T05:25:59Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-11T05:25:59Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system lies south of the Bight and will move into the Tasman Sea on Thursday. A low pressure system over Western Australian will move over South Australia on Friday, with an associated trough. A ridge of high pressure will follow and persist into the weekend.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-11T15:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-12T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-11T04:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-11T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Oodnadatta later tonight. Winds southerly 20 to 30 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-12T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-13T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-11T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-12T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers west of Leigh Creek, slight chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm west of Leigh Creek. Winds south to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending northeast to southeasterly in the morning then tending southeast to southwesterly in the early afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 13 and 24 with daytime temperatures reaching 32 to 39.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">High</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:00am to 5:00pm, UV Index predicted to reach 11 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-13T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-14T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-12T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-13T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers south of Yunta, medium chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northwest to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h in the morning then tending northwest to southwesterly in the middle of the day. Overnight temperatures falling to between 19 and 25 with daytime temperatures reaching 33 to 40.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-14T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-15T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-13T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-14T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Slight chance of a shower in the far northeast, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning and afternoon. Winds south to southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 17 and 25 with daytime temperatures reaching 30 to 39.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-15T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-16T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-14T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-15T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny morning. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Oodnadatta in the afternoon and evening. Winds southerly 25 to 35 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 22 with daytime temperatures reaching 27 to 35.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
